      "cooked": "<p>My brother says I should put these out here. &nbsp;So, here they are.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Architect is a master planner, able to out-think any situation, with some time. &nbsp;His abilities are primarily ongoings that have effects when destroyed. &nbsp;And his power destroys them.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Chronos is a master of time, able to play his deck backwards or forwards.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The drunken master sets up drinks then uses them to power different abilities.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Can't seem to paste. &nbsp; Will try in the next post.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit: &nbsp;Paste went poorly. &nbsp;Don't think it likes my phone. &nbsp;Wll post when I get home.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit edit: &nbsp;characters redacted due to comments below.</p>",
